    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Devoted of Ynnead",
    "summary": "Your army has 3 rules:\n\n- **Lethal Intent**: as the opponent's [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) ends, if 1 or more of your **YNNARI** units were **destroyed** in it, pick 1 **YNNARI INFANTRY** or **YNNARI MOUNTED** unit of yours that had been within 6\" of a destroyed unit; it may make a **Normal move** of D6+1\" at most.\n- **Lethal Surge**: once per turn, if a **YNNARI** unit of yours uses its Fade Back Agile Manouvre, that unit may make a **[surge move](vsdata:core-rule/surge-move)** (D6+1\" at most) in place of a normal move.\n- **Lethal Reprisal**: as the [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) begins, pick 1 **YNNARI** unit of yours, other than a **TITANIC** unit, that is under its **Starting Strength**; it has **[Fights First](vsdata:core-ability/fights-first)** until the phase ends.",
